---
const tableUrl = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/wubi86.txt`;
---
<section id="try" class="ruled">
  <div class="wrap sec">
    <div class="head">
      <div class="eyebrow">试一试</div>
      <h2 class="h2">不用安装，先在这里打几个字</h2>
      <p class="lead">下面这块是末笔的网页版：同一张码表，同样的上屏规则。先把系统输入法切到英文，再点进去打字。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pad" data-playground data-table={tableUrl}>
      <div class="toolbar">
        <span class="status" data-status>码表还没有载入</span>
        <span class="tools">
          <button type="button" class="link" data-clear hidden>清空自造词</button>
          <button type="button" class="mode" data-mode aria-live="polite" title="轻按 Shift 切换">中</button>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <textarea data-input rows="6" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" aria-label="试打区域" placeholder="试试 ggtt、wqvb、/rq，或者打一个没有的编码再按 =" disabled></textarea>
        <div class="pg-panel" data-panel hidden></div>
      </div>
      <p class="tips">
        <span><kbd class="key">空格</kbd> 上屏</span>
        <span><kbd class="key">1 – 5</kbd> 选字</span>
        <span><kbd class="key">-</kbd><kbd class="key">=</kbd> 翻页</span>
        <span><kbd class="key">=</kbd> 造词</span>
        <span><kbd class="key">/</kbd> 快捷输入</span>
        <span><kbd class="key">Shift</kbd> 中英</span>
      </p>
      <p class="fine">网页版没有拼音反查、调频和设置；自造词只存在这个浏览器里。需要实体键盘。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import '../ime/playground';
</script>

<style>
  .pad { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 14px 20px 20px; box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(60, 50, 35, .10); }
  .toolbar { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; min-height: 36px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--sub); }
  .tools { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  button { font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
  .link { white-space: nowrap; border: 0; background: none; color: var(--sub); padding: 0; text-decoration: underline; }
  .mode { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 8px; border: 0; background: var(--ac); color: #fff; font-size: 15px; }
  .mode.en { background: #2C3038; }
  .field { position: relative; }
  textarea {
    display: block; width: 100%; min-height: 190px; resize: vertical; padding: 16px 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8;
  }
  textarea:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--ac); outline-offset: 1px; }
  textarea:disabled { opacity: .6; }
  .tips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 24px; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--sub); }
  .tips span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .tips .key { height: 26px; min-width: 26px; font-size: 12px; border-bottom-width: 2px; }
  .fine { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--sub); }
</style>

<style is:global>
  /* Drawn by the script, so these cannot be scoped to the component. */
  .pg-panel { position: absolute; z-index: 5; max-width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; padding: 6px; border-radius: 12px; background: #FCFCFD; color: #1D1D1F; border: 1px solid #D4D4DA; box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(29, 29, 31, .16); overflow-x: auto; }
  .pg-panel[hidden] { display: none; }
  .pg-bar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; height: 20px; padding: 0 8px; gap: 28px; font-size: 11px; color: #5C5C61; white-space: pre; }
  .pg-code { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--ac); }
  .pg-row { display: flex; gap: 2px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .pg-it { height: 34px; padding: 0 10px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: none; color: inherit; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font: inherit; font-size: 19px; cursor: pointer; }
  .pg-it i { font-style: normal; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: #5C5C61; }
  .pg-it.on { background: var(--ac); color: #fff; }
  .pg-it.on i { color: #fff; }
  .pg-msg { margin: 0; padding: 6px 8px 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #5C5C61; white-space: pre; }
</style>
